WEBVTT

00:00:04.568 --> 00:00:07.195
Master, where to next?

00:00:07.320 --> 00:00:08.905
Well...uh...

00:00:09.197 --> 00:00:12.826
We got the hotpot ingredients,
so that leaves toilet paper

00:00:12.909 --> 00:00:14.077
and shampoo...

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:22.669
I guess popularity gets you places...

00:00:24.171 --> 00:00:26.465
Must be cool having
your own action figure.

00:00:26.965 --> 00:00:28.675
I will contact
the toy manufacturers.

00:00:29.009 --> 00:00:32.095
No. That's something you wait for
the other side to approach you about.

00:00:33.096 --> 00:00:34.097
Let's go.

00:00:34.264 --> 00:00:35.223
Right!

00:00:35.557 --> 00:00:37.267
Master, where to?

00:00:39.269 --> 00:00:40.270
What the hell—?!

00:00:42.939 --> 00:00:46.401
My obsession with reptiles
has turned me into one!

00:00:46.526 --> 00:00:49.029
I am the great Tongue-Stretcher!

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:50.989
— It's a monster!
— Run!

00:00:51.114 --> 00:00:53.700
All you sweet young things
are mine now.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.244
See, you're gonna bear my brood!

00:01:04.503 --> 00:01:06.088
Whoa, you surprised me!

00:01:08.131 --> 00:01:10.217
Th-That aura...

00:01:11.635 --> 00:01:12.969
That face!

00:01:15.138 --> 00:01:18.016
He... He's no ordinary man.

00:01:18.642 --> 00:01:20.936
Not again...
I dont want to be a hero anymore.

00:01:22.270 --> 00:01:25.023
That's the hero they say is
the strongest man on Earth!

00:01:25.148 --> 00:01:25.941
It's King!

00:01:26.024 --> 00:01:28.819
No wonder he looks familiar!
This dude's a legend...

00:01:28.985 --> 00:01:30.237
He'll take you out
with one punch!

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:31.655
Gimme your autograph!

00:01:31.738 --> 00:01:33.240
King! King!

00:01:33.323 --> 00:01:36.743
King! King! King! King!

00:01:37.119 --> 00:01:39.746
King! King! King!

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:43.041
I-I-| sincerely apologize
for what I've done, sir!

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:44.793
Hell yeah, King!

00:01:44.876 --> 00:01:45.919
That pervy creep!

00:01:46.211 --> 00:01:47.170
— Disgusting!
— Disgusting!

00:01:47.337 --> 00:01:49.047
Teach him a lesson, King!

00:01:49.339 --> 00:01:50.966
How did it come to this?

00:01:51.049 --> 00:01:52.759
The monster's on its knees
apologizing!

00:01:52.843 --> 00:01:54.010
King's the real deal!

00:01:54.136 --> 00:01:56.805
King, are you here because
you sensed the monster's presence?

00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:59.141
No, I was just out shopping and—

00:01:59.266 --> 00:01:59.975
Hey, hold up!

00:02:00.058 --> 00:02:02.644
Who do you think you are,
talking to King so casually?

00:02:02.853 --> 00:02:04.062
It's okay, I don't—

00:02:04.187 --> 00:02:05.355
Just a handshake, then?

00:02:06.356 --> 00:02:07.691
I have things to do.

00:02:08.525 --> 00:02:09.943
Could you let me through?

00:02:10.026 --> 00:02:11.570
W-We're so sorry!

00:02:11.695 --> 00:02:13.196
Give him room! Break it up!

00:02:13.947 --> 00:02:18.034
VIDEO GAME STORE PAZUURU

00:02:18.702 --> 00:02:20.245
All right, got me a copy...

00:02:20.871 --> 00:02:23.540
"Heartbeat Hottie Sisters 2,"
the limited edition.

00:02:23.915 --> 00:02:26.126
Nothing like that feeling
on the walk home

00:02:26.209 --> 00:02:28.170
after you buy a game.

00:02:29.379 --> 00:02:31.047
Can't wait to get home and play.

00:02:32.382 --> 00:02:34.259
CLASS S, RANK 7
KING

00:02:34.926 --> 00:02:37.512
Master, that does appear
to be King.

00:02:38.305 --> 00:02:39.264
Who?

00:02:39.556 --> 00:02:41.641
One of the heroes from
the Class S meeting.

00:02:42.767 --> 00:02:45.145
I've been waiting three years
for this sequel...

00:02:47.480 --> 00:02:49.357
My body Is ready!

00:02:50.108 --> 00:02:54.738
RETURN OF THE HERO

00:02:54.821 --> 00:02:57.240
He quickly outranked you, Master,

00:02:57.574 --> 00:02:59.367
and claimed the title
of strongest hero.

00:03:01.161 --> 00:03:03.914
However, what could he be doing
around here?

00:03:05.665 --> 00:03:07.250
M-Monster!

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:09.419
A monster?

00:03:09.794 --> 00:03:10.837
Master, we must—

00:03:11.588 --> 00:03:12.714
No, wait.

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:16.384
This might be a good opportunity
to observe King's capabilities.

00:03:17.135 --> 00:03:18.220
Let's see what he does.

00:03:21.556 --> 00:03:23.225
My moniker is G4.

00:03:23.391 --> 00:03:25.936
I ama machine god created by
The Organization.

00:03:26.269 --> 00:03:28.271
You are King, the Class S hero.

00:03:28.813 --> 00:03:30.357
Prepare to be liquidated!

00:03:30.523 --> 00:03:32.859
LooK! It's King!
That's him over there!

00:03:32.943 --> 00:03:38.573
You do know that I am King,
the Class S, Rank 7 hero?

00:03:42.702 --> 00:03:45.288
Killing you
is the reason I've come!

00:03:50.543 --> 00:03:51.461
What's that sound?

00:03:51.544 --> 00:03:53.088
You don't know
about the King Engine?

00:03:53.797 --> 00:03:56.508
It's the sound of King
going into battle.

00:03:56.967 --> 00:03:59.928
They say not a single monster
has heard it and survived.

00:04:00.679 --> 00:04:01.471
Know this.

00:04:01.554 --> 00:04:04.808
I am conducting a live test of
my combat Al systems.

00:04:04.891 --> 00:04:05.809
For data collection purposes,

00:04:05.934 --> 00:04:07.644
I expect you to fight at
maximum strength.

00:04:07.852 --> 00:04:09.312
/s this thing a robot?

00:04:10.146 --> 00:04:11.898
Built by "The Organization"?

00:04:12.399 --> 00:04:13.900
What's he talking about?

00:04:14.484 --> 00:04:15.443
Very well.

00:04:15.819 --> 00:04:18.154
But I gotta use the john first.

00:04:18.655 --> 00:04:22.993
When I hold it in,
I can only exert 50% power.

00:04:23.368 --> 00:04:25.829
Can't collect good data
that way, eh?

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:28.290
I will wait here for ten minutes.

00:04:29.582 --> 00:04:32.294
For every extra minute,
ten humans will die.

00:04:32.919 --> 00:04:33.878
Understood?

00:04:35.672 --> 00:04:37.132
That's a tough-looking monster.

00:04:37.632 --> 00:04:40.176
Master, that appears to be a robot.

00:04:40.510 --> 00:04:41.928
A very powertul one at that.

00:04:42.637 --> 00:04:44.472
Possibly more capable than me.

00:04:45.348 --> 00:04:48.685
A troublesome foe of at least
threat level Demon.

00:04:49.519 --> 00:04:53.023
What will King's strategy be
against such a foe?

00:04:53.982 --> 00:04:56.151
So you've come to kill me?

00:04:59.529 --> 00:05:01.281
Why ts this happening to me?!

00:05:02.991 --> 00:05:04.993
I'm scared...scared, damn it!

00:05:05.285 --> 00:05:07.037
/m not strong!

00:05:07.412 --> 00:05:09.331
/m just an unemployed,
29-year-old...

00:05:09.456 --> 00:05:10.540
...Olaku loser!

00:05:11.124 --> 00:05:12.917
King Engine?! What a load!

00:05:13.168 --> 00:05:14.044
It's bullcrap!

00:05:14.169 --> 00:05:17.839
/m a coward twice,
no...ten times over!

00:05:19.049 --> 00:05:21.843
Rampaging monsters
Just show up wherever I go,

00:05:22.093 --> 00:05:24.846
then while I look the other way,
someone else defeats them!

00:05:26.056 --> 00:05:29.059
And somehow, the sarne thing
keeps happening over and over!

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:31.353
That's all it is!

00:05:32.228 --> 00:05:36.149
Before I knew it, I was sent
a Class S hero certificate

00:05:36.316 --> 00:05:38.818
and became
the "strongest new hero."

00:05:39.235 --> 00:05:42.030
It's my bad for not denying it

00:05:42.238 --> 00:05:44.240
but I never dreamed
Itd come to this!

00:05:48.244 --> 00:05:49.204
/m so screwed...

00:05:49.579 --> 00:05:51.039
I dont want to be a hero.

00:05:55.210 --> 00:05:56.211
Here it comes!

00:05:58.004 --> 00:06:00.590
Think!
There's got to be a way...

00:06:01.925 --> 00:06:02.926
No, it's impossible!

00:06:03.635 --> 00:06:06.262
It's not like a robot
Will be afraid of my name!

00:06:09.933 --> 00:06:10.892
/m sorry!

00:06:11.059 --> 00:06:13.061
/m so sorry!

00:06:16.314 --> 00:06:18.149
Someone's fighting instead of me...

00:06:18.608 --> 00:06:19.609
Im safe!

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:37.585
Was that a Rocket Punch?

00:06:43.133 --> 00:06:44.968
Want help, Genos?

00:06:45.051 --> 00:06:45.760
No!

00:06:45.844 --> 00:06:50.807
You told me to aim to become
one of the top ten in Class S.

00:06:51.933 --> 00:06:53.309
I will handle this!

00:06:54.602 --> 00:06:57.105
I have to be able to handle this
on my own!

00:06:57.397 --> 00:06:58.356
Okay...

00:06:58.898 --> 00:07:00.316
Then don't lose.

00:07:00.483 --> 00:07:01.860
Warning! Emergency evacuation!

00:07:02.068 --> 00:07:03.987
A robotic combat engine
Is wreaking havoc

00:07:04.154 --> 00:07:05.864
In the vicinity
of City M Central Park.

00:07:06.156 --> 00:07:08.783
Please evacuate
in an orderly manner.

00:07:11.286 --> 00:07:13.621
I made it home, but, man...

00:07:15.457 --> 00:07:18.835
I'm sure that robot
is gonna give me nightmares.

00:07:21.004 --> 00:07:23.131
Maybe I'll just play some games
and forget about it...

00:07:29.429 --> 00:07:33.016
The "Heartbeat Hottie Sisters" series
always aces their intro.

00:07:33.433 --> 00:07:35.560
Now fis is excitement!

00:07:35.852 --> 00:07:37.979
Hi, big fella! Inout your name.

00:07:38.229 --> 00:07:39.731
My name, huh?

00:07:40.356 --> 00:07:41.900
Using my real name would be lame...

00:07:43.359 --> 00:07:44.402
What then...?

00:07:44.903 --> 00:07:45.945
How about "King"?

00:07:46.488 --> 00:07:48.239
No, not my hero name.

00:07:48.573 --> 00:07:51.451
If someone saw the Hot Sisters
saying, "Oh, hi there, King!" I'd...

00:07:52.327 --> 00:07:53.286
Wait.

00:07:55.872 --> 00:07:57.373
Huh?

00:07:57.665 --> 00:07:59.292
Who's this guy?
Why's he here?

00:08:00.335 --> 00:08:02.003
Your window was open.

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:04.714
This is the 22nd floor.

00:08:07.717 --> 00:08:09.594
Hey, listen...!

00:08:09.969 --> 00:08:12.388
You can't just barge into
a person's home.

00:08:16.476 --> 00:08:19.979
Y-You're aware that
I'm a Class S hero?

00:08:20.063 --> 00:08:22.106
Yeah, I know. King, right?

00:08:22.941 --> 00:08:26.986
He's that Class B hero
from the Class S meeting...

00:08:27.237 --> 00:08:28.238
May I have some tea?

00:08:29.447 --> 00:08:30.240
But...

00:08:30.365 --> 00:08:33.034
I didn't take you for the type
to play this sort of game.

00:08:33.243 --> 00:08:35.119
Hi, big fella!
Input your name.

00:08:35.578 --> 00:08:37.080
Kill me now!

00:08:37.372 --> 00:08:38.414
What's this game?

00:08:39.082 --> 00:08:40.041
Looks like fun.

00:08:40.750 --> 00:08:42.961
Huh? Oh, that's an action game!

00:08:43.586 --> 00:08:44.712
Do you control a robot?

00:08:44.921 --> 00:08:45.922
Yes, exactly!

00:08:46.756 --> 00:08:48.091
That's actually my kind of game.

00:08:48.216 --> 00:08:49.759
I thought this was action too,

00:08:49.842 --> 00:08:51.928
but it turned out to be
a romance game!

00:08:52.220 --> 00:08:53.555
Damn it, bought the wrong one!

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:55.848
It says "Heartbeat Hottie Sisters"
right on it.

00:08:55.932 --> 00:08:57.892
It does?!
Not "Hurt the Haughty Starbusters"?!

00:08:58.101 --> 00:08:59.602
Oh, I've been scammed!
I'm tossing it!

00:08:59.894 --> 00:09:00.979
Then let's play this one.

00:09:01.104 --> 00:09:03.314
Good idea. That one's better...
Wait.

00:09:03.606 --> 00:09:05.483
You want to play?

00:09:05.858 --> 00:09:08.111
Can't I?
You've got time, right?

00:09:08.611 --> 00:09:10.029
What's with this guy?

00:09:10.238 --> 00:09:12.615
He's pretty pushy for a Class B.

00:09:13.658 --> 00:09:15.243
I mean, I outrank him...

00:09:22.375 --> 00:09:23.501
Incinerate.

00:09:30.008 --> 00:09:31.968
Your internal components
are slag now.

00:09:32.969 --> 00:09:35.179
It was your huge body
that was your downfall.

00:09:44.606 --> 00:09:47.483
The pilot?
No, its true form.

00:09:47.859 --> 00:09:48.818
Watch it!

00:09:51.613 --> 00:09:54.699
Hey, King, you're really good.

00:09:54.824 --> 00:09:59.245
Well, I've won a few
fighting game tournaments.

00:09:59.412 --> 00:10:02.290
Tournament champ?
You're strong in real life

00:10:02.373 --> 00:10:04.125
and tops in games, too?

00:10:04.375 --> 00:10:06.377
How long Is this guy staying?

00:10:06.711 --> 00:10:07.920
— Just go...
— So...

00:10:08.338 --> 00:10:09.672
Why'd you run off earlier?

00:10:11.257 --> 00:10:13.343
I mean,
Genos is fighting the monster now,

00:10:13.968 --> 00:10:16.471
but you're a crazy-strong
Class S hero, right?

00:10:17.096 --> 00:10:19.891
How come you ran from that
robot monster?

00:10:20.558 --> 00:10:22.644
I followed you here to ask you,

00:10:23.019 --> 00:10:24.479
but you were just playing games.

00:10:25.855 --> 00:10:28.024
You bored of fighting monsters?

00:10:28.566 --> 00:10:32.445
Could you maybe be so strong,
you don't feel like fighting?

00:10:32.987 --> 00:10:35.198
Please. Talk to me.

00:10:37.033 --> 00:10:38.409
This is an emergency
evacuation warming.

00:10:38.660 --> 00:10:41.037
A giant bird monster has appeared
in the skies above City M.

00:10:41.245 --> 00:10:42.705
Threat level: Demon.

00:10:42.872 --> 00:10:44.749
— Do not go outside.
— Another one.

00:10:45.249 --> 00:10:46.292
We repeat...

00:10:46.542 --> 00:10:48.544
That's the third one today.

00:10:48.711 --> 00:10:50.880
What're you gonna do?
Think I'll take off.

00:10:57.762 --> 00:10:58.930
That startled me.

00:10:59.222 --> 00:11:02.058
You know, these threats
keep coming straight to you.

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:06.229
Something about you may be
attracting monsters, King.

00:11:07.438 --> 00:11:08.731
He's right...

00:11:08.898 --> 00:11:11.150
I've always had awful luck.

00:11:11.901 --> 00:11:13.277
What do you do in these situations?

00:11:13.444 --> 00:11:15.697
And lately,
It's been the absolute worst.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:17.657
This thing came to your house.

00:11:18.032 --> 00:11:19.158
You kinda have to fight.

00:11:26.499 --> 00:11:28.042
I have to do something
about these beams.

00:11:32.588 --> 00:11:33.589
Come down here!

00:11:33.965 --> 00:11:35.967
My objective is King alone.

00:11:36.092 --> 00:11:38.428
I have no time for your games!

00:11:40.763 --> 00:11:43.141
Please, just give me a break!

00:11:44.308 --> 00:11:47.562
Again...and again...
and again!

00:11:48.938 --> 00:11:51.149
I just happen to get caught up.

00:11:52.608 --> 00:11:54.277
All I ever do Is run away.

00:11:55.611 --> 00:11:57.947
And then, someone else
beats the monster.

00:11:59.115 --> 00:12:01.200
I just find myself passing by,

00:12:01.701 --> 00:12:03.828
then people think
I defeated the monster.

00:12:05.246 --> 00:12:07.749
I've never even been in a fight.

00:12:08.916 --> 00:12:09.876
"King..."

00:12:10.460 --> 00:12:14.297
"The hero's hero."
"The strongest man on Earth."

00:12:14.672 --> 00:12:16.758
How ao I deserve those titles?

00:12:16.924 --> 00:12:17.967
What a joke...

00:12:18.509 --> 00:12:21.262
I'm just a giant ball of les!

00:12:30.605 --> 00:12:31.647
Curse you!

00:12:36.444 --> 00:12:36.819
What's this?!

00:12:43.743 --> 00:12:45.077
Stop your infernal—

00:12:47.455 --> 00:12:49.081
The steam is diffusing my lasers!

00:12:50.541 --> 00:12:52.502
You seem to be targeting King,

00:12:52.668 --> 00:12:56.047
but I Know a man
who is even stronger.

00:12:59.175 --> 00:13:01.052
Aren't you going to fight, King?

00:13:01.177 --> 00:13:02.345
You have it all wrong!

00:13:02.804 --> 00:13:05.139
The King the public adores
isnt me!

00:13:06.182 --> 00:13:08.684
Oh.../ have to tell him!

00:13:08.810 --> 00:13:10.686
lfl dont, hel...!

00:13:11.479 --> 00:13:13.147
You see, actually I'm...

00:13:23.533 --> 00:13:25.201
What you said, is it true?

00:13:25.785 --> 00:13:29.080
Your reputation and record...
those are all lies?

00:13:30.873 --> 00:13:33.209
When you wet your pants
after the bird appeared...

00:13:33.709 --> 00:13:34.836
That was for real?

00:13:35.545 --> 00:13:37.213
How's he still standing there?

00:13:37.463 --> 00:13:38.214
Where's the bird?

00:13:38.297 --> 00:13:39.298
Did he...?

00:13:40.049 --> 00:13:40.675
Huh?!

00:13:40.758 --> 00:13:41.884
You all right?

00:13:50.351 --> 00:13:51.394
Helo! Somebody!

00:13:51.519 --> 00:13:53.145
Hey! Easy there.

00:13:53.729 --> 00:13:55.147
I took the monster down.

00:13:56.065 --> 00:13:57.233
/s your eye okay?

00:13:57.984 --> 00:13:59.318
Open it slowly.

00:14:01.404 --> 00:14:02.405
Can you see?

00:14:04.031 --> 00:14:05.992
Wh-Who are you?

00:14:06.868 --> 00:14:09.161
Me? You know...

00:14:09.912 --> 00:14:12.415
Just someone trying to be
4 hero for fun.

00:14:13.457 --> 00:14:14.876
But youre hurt...

00:14:15.084 --> 00:14:16.919
This? It's not so bad...

00:14:17.962 --> 00:14:19.505
Plus I scored a big win today!

00:14:24.427 --> 00:14:25.928
It's you...

00:14:30.433 --> 00:14:32.184
Hey! What's the matter?
Hey!

00:14:33.144 --> 00:14:34.270
I'm so sorry!

00:14:37.899 --> 00:14:39.775
Is it fun for you?

00:14:40.443 --> 00:14:43.112
Being a hero while telling lies
and running away?

00:14:44.113 --> 00:14:45.406
It's no fun at all.

00:14:45.823 --> 00:14:50.161
Well, it's not my business and
I'm not going to lecture you.

00:14:50.494 --> 00:14:51.454
Um...

00:14:51.871 --> 00:14:55.124
I might have gotten some credit
for your victories, Saitama.

00:14:55.833 --> 00:14:58.127
Credit isn't the issue here.

00:14:58.711 --> 00:15:00.880
You're everyone's hero now.

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:02.632
No, I'm just—

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:04.800
Whatever you're gonna Say,

00:15:05.134 --> 00:15:07.678
everyone thinks
you're the strongest hero there is.

00:15:08.679 --> 00:15:11.599
King, do you want to
keep on lying?

00:15:12.141 --> 00:15:13.309
Or quit being a hero?

00:15:13.726 --> 00:15:15.686
I can't find the courage to decide...

00:15:16.062 --> 00:15:18.648
Then why don't you just get strong?

00:15:19.231 --> 00:15:19.982
What?

00:15:20.107 --> 00:15:21.067
I'm heading out.

00:15:21.943 --> 00:15:22.652
See you.

00:15:22.777 --> 00:15:23.819
Hold on!

00:15:24.695 --> 00:15:25.863
You're not angry?

00:15:26.781 --> 00:15:30.701
You worked so hard
to become a hero, while I...

00:15:31.577 --> 00:15:34.330
I'll drop by again to play games.
Okay?

00:15:37.291 --> 00:15:38.167
Yeah...

00:15:41.462 --> 00:15:42.421
Sure.

00:15:44.298 --> 00:15:45.257
Doctor Kuseno...

00:15:45.883 --> 00:15:48.010
This came from
a machine god called G4.

00:15:49.136 --> 00:15:52.264
It possessed incredible power
and a highly advanced Al.

00:15:53.182 --> 00:15:55.059
If any of its components
are compatible,

00:15:55.184 --> 00:15:56.227
please install them on me.

00:15:56.519 --> 00:15:57.895
Th-This is...

00:15:58.437 --> 00:16:00.606
Genos, how did you obtain
this thing?

00:16:01.482 --> 00:16:02.441
Doctor...

00:16:03.150 --> 00:16:05.027
I have to become stronger.

00:16:05.695 --> 00:16:08.197
Very well, I'll see what I can do.

00:16:08.656 --> 00:16:10.992
There are still places
where we can improve you.

00:16:11.826 --> 00:16:12.868
Thank you very much.

00:16:13.411 --> 00:16:18.124
But Genos, though you became
a cyborg to pursue justice,

00:16:18.374 --> 00:16:20.209
you mustn't take it too far.

00:16:20.418 --> 00:16:23.170
No. Pushing my limits
comes with the job.

00:16:23.838 --> 00:16:27.383
My goal now is to make
the Class S top ten.

00:16:27.717 --> 00:16:31.220
The reckless goal
set by your mentor, yes?

00:16:32.054 --> 00:16:34.056
I had a feeling you'd mention that.

00:16:35.808 --> 00:16:38.728
Be that as it may, Genos,
speaking of cyborgs...

00:16:38.853 --> 00:16:41.063
Have you found any clues
to the cyborg

00:16:41.188 --> 00:16:43.232
that destroyed your hometown?

00:16:45.109 --> 00:16:48.529
Lately, you seem focused
on being a hero.

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.991
Regarding that incident...
I have found no clues.

00:16:52.867 --> 00:16:55.119
I see. Still

00:16:55.369 --> 00:17:00.082
That rogue cyborg has attacked
many towns and killed many people.

00:17:01.167 --> 00:17:03.252
I will find him...

00:17:03.753 --> 00:17:05.796
and tear him apart
with my own hands.

00:17:06.297 --> 00:17:07.256
Whatever it takes...

00:17:07.882 --> 00:17:08.841
Whatever the cost!

00:17:09.467 --> 00:17:11.927
He has become a hero
and found a mentor,

00:17:12.136 --> 00:17:14.221
yet the hatred rernains unabated...

00:17:15.639 --> 00:17:18.059
I'm worried about you, Genos.

00:17:18.934 --> 00:17:21.854
I am on the trail
of that cyborg as well.

00:17:22.188 --> 00:17:25.441
I'm painfully aware of
how dangerous he can be.

00:17:25.941 --> 00:17:30.029
If you should encounter him,
don't do anything rash.

00:17:30.237 --> 00:17:32.114
Instead, contact me immediately!

00:17:32.740 --> 00:17:35.284
You are cool-headed and smart...

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:38.370
But the passions of youth
can lead one to ruin.

00:17:38.788 --> 00:17:41.123
Don't try to fight him alone.

00:17:41.540 --> 00:17:43.876
Doctor Kuseno, I understand.

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:47.088
That battle we will fight together.

00:17:49.465 --> 00:17:54.762
I lead the Hero Association Earthdoom
Prophecy Emergency Response Team.

00:17:54.845 --> 00:17:56.305
You can call me Sitch.

00:17:57.098 --> 00:17:59.350
Let me start by thanking you all,

00:17:59.475 --> 00:18:01.936
the members of
the criminal underworld,

00:18:02.019 --> 00:18:03.104
for answering our call.

00:18:03.938 --> 00:18:05.314
As I said before,

00:18:05.481 --> 00:18:08.067
nothing of your nefarious pasts,
records or activities

00:18:08.150 --> 00:18:09.860
will be discussed.

00:18:10.486 --> 00:18:12.113
This is not a trap.

00:18:12.446 --> 00:18:15.491
The heroes you see are here
only for my protection.

00:18:15.616 --> 00:18:16.951
He say "heroes"?

00:18:17.201 --> 00:18:19.620
Sounds like fun.
We'll kill 'em dead!

00:18:19.912 --> 00:18:23.624
They will take no actions
unless you do something foolish.

00:18:23.999 --> 00:18:26.585
What, like taking over
your little HQ here?

00:18:28.921 --> 00:18:31.215
I see wanted men with huge bounties
on their heads,

00:18:31.549 --> 00:18:33.175
top assassins, even fugitives...

00:18:33.926 --> 00:18:36.137
What could Sitch
have been thinking,

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:37.763
inviting this scum to HQ?

00:18:38.472 --> 00:18:41.016
I don't give a crap
why they're here,

00:18:41.142 --> 00:18:44.687
but seeing 'em laughing it up
is pissing me off.

00:18:45.020 --> 00:18:46.939
At the first sign of trouble,

00:18:47.022 --> 00:18:48.649
I'm letting loose.

00:18:49.275 --> 00:18:53.988
I have three Class A heroes,
each with Class S combat skills.

00:18:54.655 --> 00:18:55.698
With them here,

00:18:55.781 --> 00:18:57.950
I doubt anyone would be
stupid enough to get violent.

00:18:58.534 --> 00:19:00.995
Shall we begin, then?

00:19:01.078 --> 00:19:02.037
Hold it.

00:19:02.705 --> 00:19:04.707
Where is the hero called "Saitama"?

00:19:05.207 --> 00:19:07.376
Doesn't he live in this building?

00:19:07.877 --> 00:19:09.879
Huh? Who are you?

00:19:10.796 --> 00:19:13.966
At any rate, please save
unrelated topics for later.

00:19:14.341 --> 00:19:15.718
What I have to say is important.

00:19:15.926 --> 00:19:18.804
He's not here?
Then I'm done.

00:19:19.305 --> 00:19:21.348
Think you can leave
without hearing us out?

00:19:21.807 --> 00:19:24.059
You came, so you're staying.

00:19:24.476 --> 00:19:28.230
"Occurrences of Tiger-level threats
and above are extremely high."

00:19:28.647 --> 00:19:29.732
"This month,"

00:19:29.815 --> 00:19:32.193
"levels are six times the average
of the past three years."

00:19:32.568 --> 00:19:35.029
"This could indicate
the 'Earthdoom' prophecy"

00:19:35.070 --> 00:19:37.615
"of the Great Seer Shibabawa
is approaching."

00:19:37.740 --> 00:19:40.910
EARTHDOOM PROPHECY
COUNTERMEASURE MEETING

00:19:41.410 --> 00:19:42.912
"If this continues,"

00:19:42.995 --> 00:19:45.331
"our heroes will become
exhausted and be overwhelmed."

00:19:46.207 --> 00:19:48.292
"The prophecy says
an unprecedented disaster"

00:19:48.417 --> 00:19:50.711
"will befall the Earth
within six months."

00:19:51.045 --> 00:19:53.923
"Current conditions make clear
that the threat remains."

00:19:54.924 --> 00:19:58.052
"We've begun sending out
even Class S heroes,"

00:19:58.135 --> 00:20:01.847
"but there are too many threats
to handle them all."

00:20:03.849 --> 00:20:06.936
"The situation will only escalate"

00:20:07.019 --> 00:20:09.021
"and we fight to protect
all of humanity."

00:20:09.313 --> 00:20:11.357
"Therefore,
despite your character issues,"

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:13.651
"we are asking the able fighters
among you"

00:20:14.109 --> 00:20:16.153
"to assist us in our efforts."

00:20:16.487 --> 00:20:18.239
So that's what this is?

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:20.741
I refuse.

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:24.745
Why that—!
I didn't hand those out yet!

00:20:24.995 --> 00:20:25.579
How did he—?!

00:20:26.288 --> 00:20:29.375
If I had to play hero
with you people...

00:20:30.668 --> 00:20:32.253
...I'd puke my guts out!

00:20:36.006 --> 00:20:38.133
Darn it. What a waste.

00:20:38.884 --> 00:20:42.846
lt was a good opportunity for
an outsider to slip into Hero HQ.

00:20:43.305 --> 00:20:48.060
But all I know is his name, face
and that he's Class B, Rank 33.

00:20:48.727 --> 00:20:50.854
HERO NAME SAITAMA

00:20:51.397 --> 00:20:52.564
I don't believe it.

00:20:53.941 --> 00:20:54.650
Yes...

00:20:55.234 --> 00:21:00.572
His scores were the highest ever
on the physical tests.

00:21:00.739 --> 00:21:02.324
CLASS B, RANK 1
HELLISH BLIZZARD

00:21:02.783 --> 00:21:06.036
Despite no further notable reports
of achievements,

00:21:06.620 --> 00:21:08.872
he rose from Class C to Class B.

00:21:09.248 --> 00:21:11.041
And he did it very quickly
after his debut.

00:21:11.375 --> 00:21:13.502
There's something about this man.

00:21:14.211 --> 00:21:16.297
There has to be...

00:21:16.839 --> 00:21:18.340
...some secret to his strength.

00:21:21.844 --> 00:21:23.846
We'll need to locate him first.

00:21:24.013 --> 00:21:25.014
— Right!
— Right!

00:21:25.848 --> 00:21:28.434
I'll make sure I find him,
and then he'll regret...

00:21:28.934 --> 00:21:32.771
... twice embarrassing
Speed-o'-Sound Sonic.

00:21:33.188 --> 00:21:35.190
We're coming for you...

00:21:35.566 --> 00:21:37.026
Just you wait...

00:21:37.901 --> 00:21:39.069
— ...Saitama!
— ...Saitama!

00:21:43.157 --> 00:21:45.409
Hey, why're you taking
all the items?

00:21:45.534 --> 00:21:46.493
Quit screwing around.

00:21:46.869 --> 00:21:48.245
Snooze you lose.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:50.748
This is co-op play, dumbass!

00:21:50.873 --> 00:21:52.875
I haven't gotten one power-up!
How can we beat the Boss?

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:54.877
I can beat him alone.
It'll be fine.

00:21:57.212 --> 00:21:59.089
Oh, the controller broke.

00:21:59.673 --> 00:22:00.632
What?

00:22:15.564 --> 00:22:17.649
Through the once tranquil town

00:22:17.733 --> 00:22:19.985
A thunderous roar peals forth

00:22:20.069 --> 00:22:23.906
Watch out! Freak out! Monsters!

00:22:24.865 --> 00:22:26.909
Who 1s going to take the lead

00:22:27.076 --> 00:22:29.411
When we destroy the evil ones?

00:22:29.661 --> 00:22:34.333
Destruction, contusion...
Loosen up!

00:22:34.500 --> 00:22:36.418
We know, We are...

00:22:36.585 --> 00:22:39.129
HEROES!

00:22:39.254 --> 00:22:40.881
Why were you

00:22:41.048 --> 00:22:43.175
born of evil?

00:22:43.300 --> 00:22:45.260
If you wish to know

00:22:45.427 --> 00:22:47.638
I shall tell!

00:22:47.763 --> 00:22:53.560
This night the punching fist
of glorious justice

00:22:53.769 --> 00:22:57.064
Will shatter your fate apart!

00:22:58.399 --> 00:23:02.945
That word exists for you
and you alone

00:23:03.112 --> 00:23:07.616
Raise your silent fist
to the sky!

00:23:07.783 --> 00:23:12.287
The apostle bears
the weight of solitude

00:23:12.454 --> 00:23:18.460
For a peace not tilled
with hatred

00:23:18.627 --> 00:23:21.964
He must fight!

00:23:34.810 --> 00:23:37.104
Guess we'll be compensated
for our time, yeah?

00:23:38.021 --> 00:23:39.481
Hey! Hey! Hey!

00:23:40.315 --> 00:23:42.609
This "prophecy" is pretty sweet...

00:23:45.112 --> 00:23:49.867
THE HUMAN MONSTER
